        "cooked": "<p>There was one point where I decided to take the hit rather than lose my setup, but otherwise this was a pretty standard damage race.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5f864e3ed4a86ba779732bbd192ee28c69a2071b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/5f864e3ed4a86ba779732bbd192ee28c69a2071b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f864e3ed4a86ba779732bbd192ee28c69a2071b_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dD36HY5Ooh9fpnoXncaLem5mTP5\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f864e3ed4a86ba779732bbd192ee28c69a2071b_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f864e3ed4a86ba779732bbd192ee28c69a2071b_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f864e3ed4a86ba779732bbd192ee28c69a2071b_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5f864e3ed4a86ba779732bbd192ee28c69a2071b_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 210 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Also definitely should’ve won a round earlier than I did, which would’ve resulted in them all ending with more health, but I accidentally shot AZ thinking Bunker was dealing fire damage…</p>",
